        {
          "text": "Wakapenzegwa akufwiinsigwa, nekubaboobo taakwe naakabbanuna mulomo wakwe abuniini. Wakeenzegwa mbuli kabelele kaya kukujayigwa, ambuli imbelele iiumuna mumaanza aasikugela, mbubonya alakwe takajulidwe mulomo wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
