        },
        {
          "text": "Wakabikwa mukabanda antoomwe abasizibi, wakazikwa amuvubi, nekuba kuti taakwe bubi mbwaakacitide, alimwi taakwe naakaamba calweeno abuniini.",
          "type": "text",
