        {
          "text": "Pele lukanze lwa-Jehova ndolwakamuuma. Ngonguwe iwakamupenzya. Naazoolituula mbuli cipaizyo cakumanya milandu yabantu, uyoobona lunyungu lwakwe, uyoongola mubuumi bwakwe, nkabela makanze aa-Jehova ayooya kunembo mumaanza aakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
