        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako njoomupa caabilo antoomwe abapati, uyooabilwa imbono antoomwe abasintaze, nkaambo wakazumina akutala buumi bwakwe, wakabalwa antoomwe abasikusotoka mulao, wakatola zibi zya bantu banji, akukombela basimilandu.",
